they go to the swings and try to forget the box . they hope to find a real treasure someday . anna and ben like to play with crayons . they have many colors and they make marks on paper . sometimes they make marks on the wall too , but mommy does not like that . she says it is not polite to make marks on the wall .

one day , anna and ben are playing with crayons in their room . anna wants to make a mark on the wall . she thinks it will be fun . she takes a red crayon and strikes the wall hard . she makes a big mark . she smiles and says , " look , ben ! i made a mark on the wall ! "

