anna and ben hug . they take their crayons and paper . they make marks on paper . they make a picture for mommy . they are polite . they are happy . lily liked to paint . she had many colors and brushes . she painted flowers and animals and houses . she made a big mess on the table and the floor . but she did not care . she was happy .

