" i love you too , dad . but i do n't like onions . " sam and ben are best friends . they like to play with cars and balls and blocks . they go to the same school and sit next to each other . they have a lot of fun .

but one day , sam is sick . he has a fever and a cough . he has to stay at home and rest . he can not go to school or play with ben . he is sad and bored . he misses ben a lot .

