one day , tommy wants to try something new . he sees a big hill near his house . he thinks it would be fun to roll his ball down the hill and see how far it goes . he runs to the hill with his ball .

he puts his ball on the top of the hill and gives it a push . the ball starts to roll down the hill very fast . tommy runs after it , but he can not catch it . the ball goes faster and faster , and tommy gets tired .

the ball reaches the bottom of the hill and keeps rolling . it rolls into a pond . the pond is cold and deep . tommy stops at the edge of the pond and looks at his ball . he is sad . he can not get his ball back .

then he sees a duck . the duck is swimming in the pond . the duck sees the ball and swims to it . the duck picks up the ball with its beak and brings it to tommy . tommy is happy . he thanks the duck and takes his ball . he hugs his ball and smiles .

tommy learned something new . he learned that rolling his ball down the hill is not a good idea . he also learned that ducks are nice and can help . he decides to play with his ball in his yard instead . he succeeds in having fun with his ball and making a new friend . sam and mia were playing in the park . they liked to ride their bikes on the paths and go down the slides . they wore helmets to keep their heads safe . they were lively and happy .

