they waved to their moms and ran back to the line . they wanted to slide again . and again . and again . they made new friends and played nicely . they had a great day at the park . tim and lily were friends . they liked to play with toys and draw pictures . one day , tim saw a new toy in the shop . it was a big red car that could make noises and move . tim wanted the toy very much , but he had no money .

