sue was also scared and sorry . she hugged tom and said , " i 'm sorry , too , mom . i should have stopped tom . i love you , tom , and i do n't want you to get hurt ! "

mom was relieved and glad . she hugged them both and said , " i love you , too , tom and sue . i 'm happy you 're both safe and sound . but you have to be more careful and sensible next time . now let 's go back to the park and have some fun ! " tim and kim are twins . they like to play and eat . one day , they see a big jar of butter in the kitchen . they love butter on their bread .

