lily and ben are sad and angry . they look at their broken house and their missing hammer . they do not want to play with max anymore . they want to make a new house . but how can they do it without a hammer ? tim and kim are twins . they like to play in the garden . one day , they see a big hedge . the hedge is green and thick . they wonder what is behind the hedge .

