they made it all the way back to the park before pippy looked down at her costume and remembered how stupid she looked . but jenna just smiled and said , " that 's ok pippy ! you were brave and that 's all that matters . " once upon a time , there was a little girl named molly . she was three years old . she loved to play with her colorful scarves . one day she asked her mom if she could help cook for dinner . her mom smiled and said , " of course ! " molly helped her mom mix together all the delicious ingredients for the dinner . when it was done her mom tasted it and said , " this is delicious ! " . molly wanted to taste it too , so she asked for a spoon . her mom said , " no , you have to wait until after dinner " . molly was sad , but she waited patiently . at dinner time , her mom said , " molly , you did such a great job helping to make this delicious dinner ! here , have a little taste " . molly tasted it and smiled .

