kiki was still a bit stubborn , but she eventually let the old man give her a hand . when they finished , kiki thanked him and ran back to her mom . kiki learned that it 's sometimes okay to ask for help -- even if it can feel a bit stupid at first . once upon a time , there were two friends : sam and lucy . sam was a jolly boy and he always had a smile on his face . lucy was also a happy girl , but she was often in bad moods .

