at that moment , sam and lucy learned an important lesson : nothing ever passes by if you look hard with a positive attitude . often , you find what you are looking for only when you can keep a jolly spirit . once upon a time , there was a little girl named lily . she loved to go outside and play in the park . one day , lily was playing on the swings when she saw a big storm coming . she quickly ran to her mom and said , " mommy , there 's a storm coming ! "

