the two little friends spent the rest of the day playing , until the sky turned dark and it was time for them to go home . but they knew they would come back again soon to take another nap in the garden . ricky was in his classroom and it was time for naptime . everyone was supposed to freeze and be quiet . ricky did not want to freeze , he wanted to move and make noise .

