one by one , people started buying the heat from jane . they put some money in her hands , and jane gave them some of the heat .

soon all the heat was gone . jane was very happy with all the money she made . and she was glad to help make everyone else 's day a bit warmer and brighter . once upon a time , there were two friends , jeff and lucy . they trusted each other so much that they could tell each other anything . one day , lucy had a lot of trouble at her house and she was very sad . jeff could see it in her eyes . he knew he had to help .

