the cat showed its owner the large watch . the owner was so happy that the cat had managed to catch it . they gave the cat lots of cuddles and praised it for being so clever .

the cat and its owner enjoyed playing with the watch together . and after that , the cat was always proud when it was out looking for things to catch . once upon a time there was a boy who was brave and strong . he was always looking for ways to help people and have fun .

one day he saw a pole in the field . he dared himself to climb the pole . he grabbed onto it , but it was very tall and he could n't reach the top .

he looked around and saw a ladder . it was very dull and made of wood , but it was tall enough to help him reach the top of the pole . he grabbed onto it and bravely started to climb .

slowly and steadily , he went higher and higher . he reached the top of the pole and smiled with pride . he had done it ! he felt so happy and brave .

he had taken a daring challenge , and he had succeeded . he was a hero ! once upon a time , there was a little girl . she wanted to study and learn lots of things . so every day , she would get her stuff , like her books and pencils , and sit down to study .

